{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Delete（DSH 插件，Web、TUI、Desktop 与 CLI 客户端）：帮助用户完整清理旧会话。它注册 session_admin 工具及 /session-list、/session-delete 命令，可列出会话、检查日志与锁状态、查看工作区及缓存关联，并预览或执行清理。删除会处理工作区记录、投影缓存和会话日志，同时对当前调用会话和运行中的会话设有规则。适合整理旧会话或清除残留记录的 DSH 用户。它读取本机 DSH_HOME 或回退目录，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:788-816","index.js:922-995","index.js:510-681"]}
{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Delete is a DSH plugin for Web, TUI, Desktop, and CLI. It adds the session_admin tool and two commands to list, inspect, preview, and remove sessions with workspace and cache records. Rules cover running sessions and the caller’s session. It uses local DSH storage and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:788-816","index.js:922-995","index.js:510-681"]}
