{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#feature-1","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Delete 的功能「列出会话」：汇总本地日志目录、工作区记录和投影缓存中发现的会话标识。通过 session_admin 的 list 操作或 /session-list 命令触发，输出会话列表及其存储来源标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:340-375","index.js:878-885","index.js:960-976"]}
{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#feature-2","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Delete 的功能「检查会话」：读取指定会话的日志目录、锁、缓存及工作区引用，并查询 Host 中的运行状态。通过 session_admin 的 inspect 操作触发，返回可供判断删除条件的会话详情，不写入数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:474-503","index.js:886-889"]}
{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#feature-3","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Delete 的功能「完整删除」：清理工作区引用、投影缓存和会话日志。用 session_admin 的 delete 操作或 /session-delete 命令触发；dryRun 可预览，运行或锁定会话需 force。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:510-583","index.js:589-681","index.js:978-986"]}
{"unit_id":"stansz__dsh-session-delete#feature-4","repo":"stansz/dsh-session-delete","commit":"d2746a8a1db6ea143e3c5c40482635cf4e1ee822","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Delete 的功能「删除前检查」：拒绝删除当前调用所处的会话，并在目标正在运行或锁仍被进程持有时阻止普通删除。删除工具还支持 dryRun 汇报可操作状态与拟清理路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:520-570"]}
